From: ra80v2-nss project
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: add Motorcomm YT9215 Option B initializer for Xiaomi AX3000 v2

Build yt9215-ra80v2 into the kernel so the YT9215 switch on mdio@90000 is
initialized in untagged dual-conduit mode at boot before netifd brings up
eth0 (dp2 / br-lan) and eth1 (dp1 / wan).

Signed-off-by: ra80v2-nss
---
--- a/drivers/net/phy/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/Makefile
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
 # Makefile for Linux PHY drivers and MDIO bus drivers
+obj-y				+= yt9215-ra80v2.o
 
 libphy-y			:= phy.o phy-c45.o phy-core.o phy_device.o \
